WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.984
[Electronic music] Think. Fast.

00:00.984 --> 00:03.400
Your crew. Full throttle.
Different places. Same starting line.

00:03.400 --> 00:05.100
One question. Everyone plays.
Same question. Your shot at a boost.

00:05.100 --> 00:06.100
[Correct-answer chime] Nailed it!

00:06.100 --> 00:09.800
[Turbo and steering effects] Three seconds of boost.
One-second answer feedback. Back in control.

00:09.800 --> 00:10.700
Nine tracks. Pick your rivalry.
Neon City and Cosmic Speedway.

00:10.700 --> 00:11.700
Take the flag.

00:11.700 --> 00:13.400
The final stretch. Make it count.

00:13.400 --> 00:16.230
[Finish jingle] The finish is yours.
Real friends. Real rivalry. One more race?

00:16.230 --> 00:20.000
Trivia Turbo. Race your friends. Settle the score.
2–8 players. Any device. Join by room code. Play free.
